classDiagram
direction TB
class ProfessionDefinition {
  professionId
  levelStatsId
  attackRange
  passiveSkillId
  professionSkillId
}
class SkillDefinition {
  skillId
  category
  targetRule
  skillRange
  effectKind
  effectParameters
}
class SkillResolver {
  CheckAvailability()
  ResolveTrigger()
  ResolveAutoCastAfterAttack()
  ResolveEffect()
}
class ISkillEffect {
  <<interface>>
  CanApply(context)
  Resolve(context)
}
class DamageEffect {
  damageType
  CanApply(context)
  Resolve(context)
}
class TauntEffect {
  CanApply(context)
  Resolve(context)
}
class ShieldEffect {
  CanApply(context)
  Resolve(context)
}
class CombatStatBuilder {
  <<PureCSharp>>
  BuildHeroStats()
}
class BattleRules {
  ResolvePlayerAction()
  ResolveEnemyPhase()
}
ProfessionDefinition --> SkillDefinition : 被动与职业技能配置
SkillResolver ..> SkillDefinition : 读取分类与效果参数
SkillResolver ..> ISkillEffect : 按效果类型选择实现
ISkillEffect <|.. DamageEffect
ISkillEffect <|.. TauntEffect
ISkillEffect <|.. ShieldEffect
CombatStatBuilder ..> ProfessionDefinition : 按职业和等级读取属性表
BattleRules ..> SkillResolver : 统一检查触发和执行效果
note for TauntEffect "本次目标已被攻击击杀则跳过，不启动新 CD"
note for ShieldEffect "按存活队友判断；不因本次击杀目标而跳过"
